Artifacts from the &lt;a href="Palaeolithic"&gt;Palaeolithic&lt;/a&gt; suggest that the moon was used to calculate time as éarly as 12,000, and possibly even 30,000 &lt;a href="Before%20Present"&gt;BP&lt;/a&gt;.
