Today, the &lt;a href="Global%20Positioning%20System"&gt;Global Positioning System&lt;/a&gt; in coordination with the &lt;a href="Network%20Time%20Protocol"&gt;Network Time Protocol&lt;/a&gt; can be used to synchronize timekeeping systems across the globe.
