Rasio C/N diukur kawas cara ngukur &lt;a href="signal-to-noise%20ratio"&gt;signal-to-noise ratio&lt;/a&gt; (S/N), tur dua spesifikasi éta ngindikasikeun kualitas saluran komunikasi.
Dina &lt;a href="teorema%20Shannon%E2%80%93Hartley"&gt;teorema Shannon–Hartley&lt;/a&gt; nu kaohor, rasio C/N sarua jeung rasio S/N.
Rasio C/N ampir sarua jeung &lt;a href="carrier-to-interference%20ratio"&gt;carrier-to-interference ratio&lt;/a&gt; (C/I, CIR), jeung &lt;a href="carrier-to-noise-and-interference%20ratio"&gt;carrier-to-noise-and-interference ratio&lt;/a&gt;, C/(N+I) atawa CNIR.
